00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:42.040
Can I come see you practice too next time?

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:44.040
You're talking about the tonguing thing,
aren't you, Shizu-chan?!

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:45.000
How much?

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:45.580
For what?!

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:47.710
Please calm down.

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:51.290
From here on, let's all learn it together!

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:55.040
Don't move onto the second step!

00:14:57.710 --> 00:15:00.290
My hiccups just won't stop...

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:03.210
Are you okay? I'd like to help you...

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:08.330
Are you still saying that?
Trying lots of things to flirt with Aki-chan, huh?

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:12.580
I'm just gonna look up ways to stop them.
Let's see, for example...

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:15.290
Like giving a strong push on the solar plexus.

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:16.790
Boing.

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:19.830
Or hopping like a bunny.

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:22.750
Bouncy bouncy bouncy bouncy.

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:28.880
The hiccups didn't stop, but Sis sure did!

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:33.380
Hmm, I wonder if there's any other good method...

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:36.500
Akiho-chan, I'll help you too!

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:38.880
Thank you...

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:42.750
I see, if you drink water
from the opposite side of the cup...

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.460
K..Kosaka-san, what happened?!

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:52.330
I tried to stop her hiccups using the method of
blocking both ears with my fingers, but suddenly...

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:55.080
Were you really only blocking them?

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:59.580
Kosaka-san, are your hiccups okay?

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:01.420
They still... won't stop.

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:04.830
But I have to put away the school supplies...

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:09.080
Please leave it to me.

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:10.960
When you two get close...

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:12.040
Raaarr!

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:13.130
You scared us!

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:15.380
Yeah, it's perfect.

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:20.040
Well then. All that's left is to jump out
at the right time.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:21.960
Can I put it in?

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:22.670
Huh?

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:27.540
If it's too sudden it will probably hurt,
so at first I'll put it in slowly, okay?

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:32.420
Wh-what is this? Have they started something risky?!
What is this prison?!

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:35.960
While you put it in, you can probably turn it a bit...

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:39.330
They're already trying out the acrobatic stuff?!

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:40.960
And in the Science prep room?!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.420
S-Sis?!

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:50.000
S-sorry! But I didn't see anything!
And I don't know what you were doing!

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:57.000
No, I don't get it even though I see it...

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:58.710
Sis, this is...

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:02.290
Huh?! Oh, i-it's okay! I understand!

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:05.960
In short, it was play involving putting
a pointed thing in and out of a hole, right?

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:07.290
Like a paper string intercourse
type of thing?!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.540
No! And what's 'paper string intercourse'?!

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:12.540
Then why were you breathing
so heavily like that?

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:15.250
Well because... I was a bit nervous.

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:17.500
Achoo!

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:21.290
They're all gone!

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:24.380
My hiccups really did stop when I sneezed!

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:25.880
In short, this is what it is.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:29.170
Oh, so that's what it was!

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:34.750
It was quite the commotion,
but everything turned out just fine-

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:36.960
Sis?

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:38.960
H-huh?

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:44.080
Wh-what do I do, Haru... This time I've got-

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.420
Is this an endless loop?

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:50.000
Please Haru, stop them!

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.460
Do something other than the paper string method...

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:57.540
Then try the drinking water one...

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:00.420
Drink a pretty big cup down in one breath.

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:04.380
Okay, I swallowed it.

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:06.500
Why are you showing me?

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:13.540
I've kinda been on the verge
of heat exhaustion lately.

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:15.790
It's miserable being in public health, huh...

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:18.830
Itchan, do you have any methods to cope with that?

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:21.580
I just eat meat every day for that.

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:27.330
I see. That's why you're always
eating wieners for lunch.

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:28.080
I guess.

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:34.580
Me too... Even though every evening
I eat the wieners of the night... I wonder why...

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:36.540
Don't you mean 'at' night?

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:39.000
Sakiccho, let's buy snacks.

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:40.670
Agreed!

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:44.040
Kana-chan, we're gonna buy a lot today too, right?

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:47.170
Yeah. There are so many types of snacks at this store!

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:52.670
But... Maybe it really is a lot?

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:54.420
I should put some back.

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:58.170
Which shelf was this on again?

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:01.710
It's got "chocolate flavor" written on it,
so maybe here?

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:05.880
This is good. To the register!

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:09.290
Which one should I get, maybe chocolate?

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:14.960
Huh? Why is THAT on a shelf with snacks?!

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:18.210
Excuse me, but... the wrong merchandise
is on this shelf...

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:22.250
Oh, but... Maybe this is my mistake?

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:27.420
What do you see here besides snacks?
C'mon, tell me...

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:32.790
That must be it, this probably isn't
the type of product I thought it was.

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:34.460
Can I help you?

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:39.250
Oh, i-it's nothing...

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:40.540
Sexy!

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:42.500
Okay, take your time...

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:45.000
Oh man, oh man...

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:48.000
I was about to make another mistake...

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:52.710
Now that I think about it,
this is a bit expensive for chocolate.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:55.080
Maybe it's a premier brand or something?

00:19:55.670 --> 00:20:00.750
Perhaps it's an amazingly delicious chocolate
that I've never tasted before!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:03.830
Melts in the mouth in 0.03 seconds!

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.790
I could say things like that!

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:06.920
Okay.

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:13.920
Excuse me, I'd like this, please!

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:16.830
She's come to buy a rubber
with such a huge smile!

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:21.750
Th-this, right... Um, that's 1300 yen.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:26.540
Okay! Oh, is it 1300 yen for one box?

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:29.960
If so, then all three boxes
you have are a bit too much...

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:32.880
No, your total is 1300 yen.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:37.920
Great, just one box wouldn't be enough!
I'm gonna eat my fill!

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.750
F-fill?!

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:41.380
Just how many rounds
do you intend to go for?!

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:45.830
Uh, I can wrap that up in a paper bag...

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:48.330
No, it's okay.

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:51.250
I'll be opening it up at school soon!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:55.040
I just... can't wait!

00:20:56.960 --> 00:21:00.080
En... Enjoy that meal!

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.170
What was that?

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:05.580
I'm going to share with everyone in class!

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:38.920
Everyone, let's eat these together!

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:40.670
Wait, is that...?!

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:41.670
What do you mean 'eat'?!

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:46.460
M-Misaki... Have you... eaten it before?

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:49.130
No, it's my first time, too.

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:51.210
That's why I'm so excited about it!

00:22:51.210 --> 00:22:52.670
Let's eat it up!

00:22:52.920 --> 00:22:54.790
But it's her first time...

00:22:54.790 --> 00:22:57.040
With... a smile like that?

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:58.630
Huh?

00:22:59.250 --> 00:23:03.920
Ten-odd seconds later,
that smile had changed into a tear-stained face.

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:11.540
I'm glad we got into the room,
but I'm slightly uneasy here...

00:23:11.540 --> 00:23:13.500
Oh! It's a vending machine!

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:15.040
Kosaka-san! Wanna drink something?!

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:17.830
Electric vibe... Twin mushrooms...
And many others...

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:19.960
So in other words,
to 'drink' that is like a face fu-

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:22.920
Whoa! Sorry! That's a different kind
of vending machine!

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:24.330
The fridge is over here, huh?!

00:23:24.330 --> 00:23:27.330
A stamina drink, a virility drink...
this lineup is, in other words-

00:23:27.330 --> 00:23:29.290
Sorry! Go ahead and take a shower first!

00:23:29.290 --> 00:23:30.960
You might catch a col...

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:33.580
Huh? "Take a shower..."

00:23:33.580 --> 00:23:35.750
That means, in other words...?!
